[Script Info]Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.709PlayResX: 1920PlayResY: 1080[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Main-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000019FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Thoughts-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Secondary-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Credits,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,56,&H00FFFFFF,&H000019FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,105,105,1.5,0,1,3.7,0,7,15,15,15,1Style: Title-207+,M+ ıc,95,&H00FEFEFE,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.5,0,2,15,15,360,1Style: Captions-PTS,Roboto,59,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,15,15,15,1Style: We-Go-Karaoke,Duality,70,&H00FF4579,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,1.8,0,1,3,0,7,30,18,15,1Style: We-Go-Translation,Duality,70,&H00FFFFFF,&H000019FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,7,30,18,92,1Style: Karaoke Main,Duality,70,&H00A24161,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: Translation Main,Duality,70,&H00FFFFFF,&H000019FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 50,0:02:15.85,0:02:17.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Ah...!Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.31,0:02:24.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mooks!Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.87,0:02:27.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He got away because of you!Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.06,0:02:29.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was our golden goose!Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.87,0:02:35.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vacate the premises! Don't think we won't arrest all of you!Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.11,0:02:38.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Navy?! Don't interrupt Soul King!Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.68,0:02:41.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's happening in there?Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.11,0:02:42.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a riot!Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.85,0:02:46.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Navy suddenly stormed in here ready to arrest Soul King,Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.28,0:02:50.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but he got away because his fans blocked the marines!Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.39,0:02:53.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it all! Why, that backstabbing...!Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.36,0:02:56.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right! This is big news!Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.39,0:02:59.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The musician Brook is on Straw Hat Luffy's crew!Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.26,0:03:00.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's actually a pirate!Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.67,0:03:11.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have my thanks! That's what I'd call good timing.Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.74,0:03:16.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Sis Shakky sent me! Your friends should be waiting at Grove 42!Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.58,0:03:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been a while! My heart is filled with anticipation!Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.08,0:03:23.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't have a heart to be filled.Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.66,0:03:30.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.69,0:03:33.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Navy is on the move, and Luffy is in the area!Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.63,0:03:38.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're taking the Sunny to Grove 42, so we'll see you there!Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.10,0:03:39.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger.Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.24,0:03:39.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.94,0:03:40.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that?Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.74,0:03:42.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, weren't you listening?Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.47,0:03:44.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well...Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.88,0:03:50.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Navy. Come. We. Ship. Run.Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.18,0:03:52.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Understand?Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.15,0:03:55.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I don't! Why are you talking like that?! Just say it normally!Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.69,0:03:59.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A meathead like you wouldn't understand it.Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.49,0:04:00.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.96,0:04:05.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. You. Later. Slashed.Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.26,0:04:06.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.66,0:04:09.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, do you hear that uproar?Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.07,0:04:09.63,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.17,0:04:14.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right. There. Noisy.Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.35,0:04:25.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up, morons!Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.19,0:04:31.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've gone and found one of the perpetrators...Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.36,0:04:33.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who dared to show me disrespect!Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.06,0:04:37.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This guy!Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.39,0:04:37.09,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.09,0:04:40.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll start by teaching this guy a lesson!Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.23,0:04:44.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll show him... just how terrifying I can be!Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.23,0:04:47.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what I'm about to do to him...Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.37,0:04:50.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will be a warning to each and every one of you!Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.81,0:04:54.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mess with me, and this is what you're gonna get!Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.65,0:04:56.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya get my meaning, lubbers?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.22,0:05:01.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A guy with a 400-million-belly bounty sure is scary!Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.95,0:05:03.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with this guy?Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.85,0:05:07.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro, Sanji, do you know him?Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.56,0:05:07.12,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.12,0:05:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, earlier...Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.86,0:05:12.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold it, you pirates!Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.10,0:05:17.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy and all his followers, surrender now!Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.63,0:05:18.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-The Navy...?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.87,0:05:23.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've blocked off every exit from Grove 46!Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.07,0:05:24.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no escape now!Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.58,0:05:28.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H... How did the Navy find out about me?Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.61,0:05:30.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.95,0:05:33.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain! We're under siege!Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.55,0:05:35.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't panic, idiot!Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.72,0:05:37.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do you think we got all these new members?Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.96,0:05:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some of 'em are worth over 100 million!Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.12,0:05:41.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we're outnumbered...Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.49,0:05:42.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just watch, dumbass!Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.36,0:05:46.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Caribou!Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.06,0:05:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Use that marine as a shield to clear a path!Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.47,0:05:50.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Marine"...?Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.63,0:05:54.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems like they may have caught one of our scouts!Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.27,0:05:55.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn, that's not good!Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.91,0:05:57.67,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Caribou?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.67,0:06:00.51,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Using him is our ticket outta here!Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.08,0:06:06.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't do that, Big Boss!Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.82,0:06:06.62,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.12,0:06:09.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because this soldier told a lie...Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.62,0:06:13.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said he hadn't called the Navy yet!Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.86,0:06:15.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.84,0:06:28.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That lunatic ignored my order!Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.27,0:06:31.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, he did it...Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.11,0:06:37.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They seem to follow an underhanded rule that lets them lie to their enemies!Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.65,0:06:39.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boy, do I find that distasteful!Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.08,0:06:44.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like they have no intention of surrendering!Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.89,0:06:46.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After them! Get those pirates!Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.76,0:06:53.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Knuckleheads! Our boss is worth 400 million! He's Straw Hat Luffy, y'know?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.50,0:06:55.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.90,0:07:00.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This ain't good, Captain. Let's run!Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.77,0:07:03.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You ingrates! Listen to your captain!Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.01,0:07:06.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why would they be calling me "boss"?Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.84,0:07:09.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Again, what do you mean by that?Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.06,0:07:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fight with courage!Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.96,0:07:26.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're...Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.76,0:07:30.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the man worth 88 million, Lip "Service" Doughty!Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.30,0:07:34.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just love the way you fight.Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.74,0:07:36.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be scared! Get ready to shoot!Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.21,0:07:44.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's got a bounty of 92 million...Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.28,0:07:46.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Albion "the Maimed"!Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.32,0:07:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't back down! Fight for justice!Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.42,0:07:53.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.83,0:08:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It stinks! Hypocrites' blood!Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.00,0:08:03.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A bounty of 210 million... Pirate "Wet-Haired" Caribou!Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.87,0:08:05.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surrender now!Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.07,0:08:09.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! You've eaten a devil fruit?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.54,0:08:13.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have done that!Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.81,0:08:16.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not healthy to push yourself too hard!Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.32,0:08:19.28,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,My sword...!Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.02,0:08:25.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Whoa! Now what's going on?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.02,0:08:26.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pacifista!Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.72,0:08:27.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.16,0:08:36.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are the Navy's human weapons here?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.47,0:08:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those're the guys that look like Kuma!Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.14,0:08:43.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But Hancock told me not to cause trouble...Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.61,0:08:47.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what the hell  do you mean by that?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.32,0:08:56.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirate Straw Hat Luffy: Confirmed.Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.69,0:09:00.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are those actual pacifista? And they're actually shooting at me?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.26,0:09:04.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pacifista, you say? How thrilling!Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.67,0:09:16.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,88-million-belly bounty, Lip "Service" Doughty: Subdued.Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.21,0:09:18.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Doughty!Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.84,0:09:25.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Follow the pacifista! Catch the pirates!Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.18,0:09:25.02,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.02,0:09:26.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One shot?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.62,0:09:29.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even with a bounty of 88 million, he was no match.Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.52,0:09:32.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is bad news... Wait, Captain, where are you going?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.69,0:09:34.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.76,0:09:34.42,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.42,0:09:38.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Morons! He wrecked Doughty, so we got no chance! We better run!Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.43,0:09:47.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss Straw Hat, do something!Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.14,0:09:52.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, those human weapons will kill us all!Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.31,0:09:54.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Boss–Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.48,0:09:55.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.35,0:09:57.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Boss is gone!Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.45,0:09:59.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Boss?Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.08,0:10:01.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do they mean Straw Hat?Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.45,0:10:04.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! My side hurts!Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.72,0:10:07.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You morons...! Run, or they'll kill–Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.83,0:10:10.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're in the way, idiot!Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.96,0:10:13.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who are you?Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.70,0:10:17.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.97,0:10:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Boss!Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.64,0:10:27.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you going around as Straw Hat?Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.44,0:10:31.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-H-Hey, bastard! Don't you know who I am?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.78,0:10:35.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way or I'll kill you and tear out your guts!Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.69,0:10:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haven't you heard?! I'm the son of Dragon the Revolutionary!Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.86,0:10:43.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the grandson of Garp the Hero!Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.59,0:10:48.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a famous pirate with a 400-million-belly bounty, Straw–Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.54,0:10:55.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is not scum like you!Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.94,0:10:58.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha...?Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.71,0:10:59.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.68,0:11:00.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah...!Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.88,0:11:02.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.81,0:11:07.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.08,0:11:09.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.55,0:11:13.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They all got tricked into joining  a fake Straw Hat crew.Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.92,0:11:16.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,PX-5, who is this guy really?Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.40,0:11:23.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirate "Triple-Tongued" Demaro Black.Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.63,0:11:26.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bounty: 26-million-belly.Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.14,0:11:27.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.00,0:11:29.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Twenty-six million? That means he's...Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.57,0:11:32.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a fake?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.41,0:11:36.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They found out! Run for it!Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.31,0:11:39.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with this loser?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.28,0:11:43.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He posed as Straw Hat Luffy and tricked us!Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.45,0:11:45.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because the real one is dead!Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.62,0:11:51.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn! I almost took orders from a weakling with a measly 26-million-belly bounty!Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.36,0:11:52.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.93,0:11:55.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was pretending to be me?Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.77,0:11:57.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji and Zoro too?Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.37,0:12:00.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They looked just like the real ones!Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.64,0:12:03.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd better leave before anything else happens.Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.11,0:12:09.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That faker is an idiot, but you morons are also out of luck.Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.05,0:12:11.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're all under arrest!Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.95,0:12:18.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And as it so happens, the real Straw Hat is here too.Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.52,0:12:23.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,PX-5 detected him the instant we entered this area.Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.96,0:12:26.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shoot him, PX-5!Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.24,0:12:38.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was close!Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.21,0:12:42.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that for?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.41,0:12:45.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This bag is holding all my precious lunches!Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.85,0:12:50.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His... His face...Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.06,0:12:58.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just like the poster!Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.83,0:13:03.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that guy was the real Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.97,0:13:05.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Form up!Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.44,0:13:08.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were already prepared to catch the real one!Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.27,0:13:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Aye, sir! – Aye, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.01,0:13:10.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.21,0:13:13.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Are you gonna try and stop me again?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.24,0:13:17.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to stay out of trouble so I can set sail!Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.71,0:13:20.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! You won't need to set sail!Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.35,0:13:25.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unlike two years ago, I'm officially a member of the Navy now!Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.82,0:13:28.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, this is where I capture you!Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.49,0:13:29.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,PX-5!Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.53,0:13:38.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too slow...Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.87,0:13:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.91,0:13:50.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gear Second!Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.05,0:13:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.53,0:14:10.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jet Pistol!Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.41,0:14:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat...Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.04,0:14:22.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's... haki!Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.95,0:14:28.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He beat the pacifista with a single blow!Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.59,0:14:37.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See ya!Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.83,0:14:40.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet we'll meet again somewhere!Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.70,0:14:42.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.10,0:14:44.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let Straw Hat escape!Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.30,0:14:45.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.64,0:14:49.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.67,0:14:50.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.57,0:14:53.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! I knew it was you!Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.01,0:14:56.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How'd you get in trouble already?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.51,0:14:58.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ohhh!Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.38,0:15:03.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's really you this time! It's been a while, guys!Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.22,0:15:06.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roronoa! Black Leg! So they really were alive!Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.99,0:15:08.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,PX-7!Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.93,0:15:18.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Outta my way! – Outta my way!Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.34,0:15:25.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I cut him!Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.64,0:15:28.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I broke his neck!Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.11,0:15:33.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the Straw Hats! The real ones!Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.28,0:15:36.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're nothing like the fake Straw Hats!Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.56,0:15:43.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, you're ninth.Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.73,0:15:45.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Imagine gloating about that!Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.90,0:15:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, hurry up! Everyone's waiting at the ship!Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.33,0:15:49.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.90,0:15:54.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away! Catch them at any cost!Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.44,0:15:55.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Aye, sir! – Aye, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.24,0:16:00.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been such a long time! I hope everyone's doing alright!Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.18,0:16:01.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.39,0:16:10.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.89,0:16:14.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh!Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.03,0:16:19.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh!Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.00,0:16:20.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.56,0:16:22.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.17,0:16:24.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dark King Rayleigh?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.71,0:16:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I came here to check on you, but you seem to be doing fine.Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.38,0:16:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've refined your skills even further.Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.25,0:16:37.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.71,0:16:41.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now get going! Your friends are waiting.Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.22,0:16:46.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! Rayleigh, thank you for everything these past two years!Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.06,0:16:51.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't like you at all. Just go!Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.70,0:17:01.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh!Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.17,0:17:05.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll do it!Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.48,0:17:15.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna become the pirate king!Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.36,0:17:29.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get Straw Hat already!Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.50,0:17:33.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oops!Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.54,0:17:35.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.27,0:17:37.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh, thank you for everything!Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.17,0:17:39.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, Rayleigh...!Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.04,0:17:42.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks again for everything!Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.41,0:17:45.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going now!Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.72,0:17:50.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes...Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.54,0:18:09.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They went that way!Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.97,0:18:11.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After them! Don't let them get away!Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.51,0:18:16.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rise to the top!Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.65,0:18:23.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are heading for Grove 42!Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.79,0:18:25.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away!Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.33,0:18:31.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that?Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.00,0:18:36.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dark King Rayleigh!Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.17,0:18:38.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My protégé is setting sail!Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.50,0:18:40.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be too hard on him.Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.24,0:18:45.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this line?Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.38,0:18:49.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I recommend you do not cross it.Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.68,0:18:58.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, bon bags! There're so many!Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.12,0:18:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's in them?Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.52,0:19:05.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're filled with food. I imagine everyone's stomachs got bigger over the past two years.Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.76,0:19:07.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll let you fill up later!Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.90,0:19:11.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?! I can't wait to eat your food!Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.13,0:19:13.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There they are! They're this way!Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.97,0:19:16.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? They circled ahead!Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.17,0:19:19.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No other choice, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.71,0:19:21.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everybody, charge!Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.71,0:19:22.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.15,0:19:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna... become a flea...Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.69,0:19:31.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? What're you...?Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.22,0:19:33.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna become a mite...Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.22,0:19:34.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.69,0:19:36.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What in the world...?Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.66,0:19:42.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I... I...Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.23,0:19:45.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna become a louse...Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.84,0:19:47.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.14,0:19:48.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must be...Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.67,0:19:53.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As I suspected,Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.64,0:19:55.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,this mess is your doing.Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.25,0:19:58.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.15,0:20:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You haven't gotten anywhere yet!Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.52,0:20:06.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right! I remember you from Thriller Bark!Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.59,0:20:08.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who was she?Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.83,0:20:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you still doing here?Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.99,0:20:15.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should be nicer to the one who brought you back to this island!Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.93,0:20:18.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't directed you, why, you'd be...Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.90,0:20:22.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just try a little gratitu–Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.41,0:20:23.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.81,0:20:26.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A real woman! A real woman!Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.54,0:20:29.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course I am! What are you, sick?Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.01,0:20:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, set sail already!Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.58,0:20:33.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I saw some Navy ships around here!Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.68,0:20:34.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What? – What?Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.18,0:20:37.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soon, there'll be no way out!Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.46,0:20:43.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.53,0:20:44.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That voice...!Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.69,0:20:49.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp-san! Nami-san! Robin-san!Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.43,0:20:52.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Frrranky-san!Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.11,0:20:57.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brook!Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.91,0:21:00.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! I can't believe you abandoned stardom!Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.91,0:21:01.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attaboy!Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.15,0:21:07.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, everybody!Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.02,0:21:10.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You two have become even more beautiful!Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.59,0:21:14.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.36,0:21:16.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been two years, so...Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.83,0:21:21.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! You wrote a song for us?Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.54,0:21:28.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...would you be so kind as to show me your pa–Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.00,0:21:29.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you think?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.81,0:21:32.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never let you see them two years ago either!Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.88,0:21:36.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I'm so excited to see you again... See?Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.21,0:21:39.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's... making my heart quiver... Although...Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.98,0:21:44.25,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't have a heart that can quiver...Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.72,0:21:44.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey... The rock star just hit rock bottom.Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.25,0:21:48.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Honestly! You guys are still immature.Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.49,0:21:54.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way... I don't see everyone on board yet.Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.70,0:21:58.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Chopper went to pick them up–Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.87,0:21:58.63,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.17,0:21:58.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Huh? – Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.81,0:22:07.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Took 'em long enough!Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.48,0:22:10.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.98,0:22:14.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everybody!Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.59,0:22:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I found them!Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.42,0:22:23.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro! Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.43,0:22:25.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.63,0:22:31.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san! I missed you so much!Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.43,0:22:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys sure do look manlier!Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.74,0:22:38.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're all back together again!Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.51,0:22:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finally–Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.35,0:22:44.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh!Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.21,0:22:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys!Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.12,0:22:57.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.06,0:23:00.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.57,0:23:08.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, thank you!Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.54,0:23:10.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say hi to everyone in the Torino Kingdom for me!Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.61,0:23:14.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Is Sanji alright?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.81,0:23:18.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One... One... One beautiful woman...Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.01,0:23:20.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stay with me!Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.91,0:23:20.52,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Two beautiful women...Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.52,0:23:23.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper, this is real bad! We gotta stop the bleeding!Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.02,0:23:27.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,F-F-Franky, you're...!Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.96,0:23:29.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.59,0:23:33.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is there something that concerns you-mecha?Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.30,0:23:37.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Mecha"?! I wanna try too!Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.23,0:23:37.20,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.97,0:23:39.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave that crap for later!Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.64,0:23:42.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like the Navy ships are already here!Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.88,0:23:48.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! When did they get here?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.28,0:23:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three Navy ships!Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.58,0:23:58.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, we need to get them before they get us!Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.29,0:24:01.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire! Send them to the depths!Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.73,0:24:05.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Slave...Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.46,0:24:07.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arrow!Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.50,0:24:15.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha...? What just happened?Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.44,0:24:17.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-It's...Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.54,0:24:22.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Kuja Pirates!Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.91,0:24:26.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who...Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.92,0:24:30.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,put a Navy ship...Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.95,0:24:34.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in my way?Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.40,0:24:44.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's... the Kuja Jolly Roger!Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.37,0:24:45.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The "Kuja"?Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.87,0:24:50.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're strong, Amazonian pirates led by the Pirate Empress, one of the Warlords.Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.71,0:24:52.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A warlord?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.11,0:24:54.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her name is Boa Hancock.Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.18,0:25:00.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They say anyone who sees her becomes infatuated and turns into stone.Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.25,0:25:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, too bright! She is dazzling!Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.32,0:25:05.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is no end to her beauty!Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.69,0:25:08.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You weren't kidding! She's a goddess!Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.26,0:25:10.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goddess?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.86,0:25:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is she?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.83,0:25:13.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goddess? Goddess?Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.16,0:25:18.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goddess... Oh, goddess... Oh, goddess... G... G... Goddess...Dialogue: 50,0:25:18.77,0:25:20.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He turned to stone!Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.17,0:25:23.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's Hancock and her pirates!Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.01,0:25:23.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,–Huh? – Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.57,0:25:27.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move your ship, Boa Hancock!Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.31,0:25:29.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to interfere with our duties?Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.71,0:25:31.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cease your baseless accusations!Dialogue: 50,0:25:31.68,0:25:34.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just don't feel like moving out of the way.Dialogue: 50,0:25:34.98,0:25:37.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sh-She's acting like a child!Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.65,0:25:38.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that a problem?Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.89,0:25:44.06,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Luffy. Now is your chance!Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.86,0:25:48.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She just winked at us...Dialogue: 50,0:25:48.70,0:25:51.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She helped us. Let's set sail now!Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.07,0:25:52.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know that warlord?Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.94,0:25:57.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I was sent to the Isle of Women and became friends with them.Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.64,0:26:00.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the legendary island full to the brim with women.Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.81,0:26:02.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't know it was real...Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.68,0:26:05.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Friends with the Pirate Empress?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.51,0:26:09.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Did you even get any training done?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.89,0:26:11.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm all set!Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.05,0:26:14.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn... It's not fair...! It's not fair...!Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.89,0:26:16.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You doing okay, Sanji?Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.36,0:26:20.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, so they're Luffy's friends!Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.40,0:26:23.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are a bunch of creatures that I've never seen before.Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.83,0:26:26.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– One, two, three, four... – Looks like they're having fun!Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.17,0:26:30.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get ready to set sail now!Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.14,0:26:31.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yes, Nami-swan!Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.91,0:26:34.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's the matter, Usopp?Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.94,0:26:39.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just that... did you guys beat back all those marines?Dialogue: 50,0:26:39.05,0:26:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. We could still hear them shouting as we were flying away.Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.62,0:26:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, why aren't they coming after us from inland?Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.43,0:26:57.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Reinforcement Platoon 3!Dialogue: 50,0:26:57.67,0:26:58.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?Dialogue: 50,0:27:00.00,0:27:01.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? What happened?Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.97,0:27:04.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't get to Grove 42!Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.61,0:27:05.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.71,0:27:07.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Because...Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.74,0:27:10.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there are huge bugs standing in our way!Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.55,0:27:12.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Bugs?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.92,0:27:16.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are they?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.42,0:27:21.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 50,0:27:29.20,0:27:33.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let them mess with Usopp-un's new adventure-un!Dialogue: 50,0:27:36.67,0:27:39.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When men part ways, we don't shed tears-un.Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.54,0:27:43.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Usopp-un!Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.11,0:27:47.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as they're not coming, that's good.Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.55,0:27:50.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If they're having trouble, we're lucky.Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.05,0:27:52.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's just leave now!Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.35,0:27:54.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, lead the way!Dialogue: 50,0:27:54.72,0:27:55.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.56,0:27:58.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.83,0:28:02.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Platoon 4.Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.03,0:28:03.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.77,0:28:07.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It suddenly started raining, and the wet gunpowder won't ignite!Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.10,0:28:08.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rain? Where is it raining?Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.80,0:28:10.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rain? Where is it raining?Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.14,0:28:14.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabaody Archipelago should be clear and sunny today!Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.95,0:28:19.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No thunder.Dialogue: 50,0:28:19.78,0:28:23.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't want civilians to get hurt.Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.05,0:28:26.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bubbles are so bothersome...Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.06,0:28:29.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we caught such a perfect wind.Dialogue: 50,0:28:29.66,0:28:32.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It brought us right to Sabaody Archipelago.Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.60,0:28:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's because Nami-chan is a good girl.Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.10,0:28:45.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Best of luck! We'll miss you up here on Weatheria!Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.42,0:29:03.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's inflating!Dialogue: 50,0:29:05.66,0:29:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? This jelly inflates?Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.07,0:29:15.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, we got a bubble roof!Dialogue: 50,0:29:15.74,0:29:16.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, everyone.Dialogue: 50,0:29:17.44,0:29:22.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A coated ship can mitigate any kind of pressure.Dialogue: 50,0:29:22.18,0:29:27.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once Franky removes the buoyancy bag supporting the ship's keel,Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.68,0:29:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Sunny's coating will make her start to sink.Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.62,0:29:32.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's how it works.Dialogue: 50,0:29:32.62,0:29:34.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– I see. – I see.Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.22,0:29:35.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too complicated, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.69,0:29:37.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, lower the sail now!Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.83,0:29:38.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sail?Dialogue: 50,0:29:38.66,0:29:42.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rather than the wind, sea currents drive a coated sailing ship.Dialogue: 50,0:29:42.83,0:29:45.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it doesn't just sink to where it's going.Dialogue: 50,0:29:46.54,0:29:49.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright! Let's hurry before the Navy shows up again!Dialogue: 50,0:29:50.71,0:29:54.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Central Platoon 5 at Grove 42!Dialogue: 50,0:29:54.08,0:29:55.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency situation!Dialogue: 50,0:29:55.74,0:29:59.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The troops that came before us, Platoon 2, have all... er... become negative!Dialogue: 50,0:29:59.65,0:30:01.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? "Negative"?!Dialogue: 50,0:30:01.78,0:30:03.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna become like moss...Dialogue: 50,0:30:03.05,0:30:05.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm no good. I wanna become a water flea...Dialogue: 50,0:30:05.85,0:30:10.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,According to them, Straw Hat Luffy got on a giant bird and flew away!Dialogue: 50,0:30:10.63,0:30:13.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bird? What are you guys doing now?!Dialogue: 50,0:30:13.20,0:30:16.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're fighting against unknown enemies!Dialogue: 50,0:30:17.20,0:30:20.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Navy reinforcements! We were about to leave...Dialogue: 50,0:30:20.87,0:30:22.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everybody!Dialogue: 50,0:30:24.74,0:30:27.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's ship is in range now!Dialogue: 50,0:30:28.51,0:30:31.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute! A giant bird is coming toward us!Dialogue: 50,0:30:41.49,0:30:42.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's him!Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.53,0:30:45.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're behind us now!Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.86,0:30:47.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got it!Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.77,0:30:51.10,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,How's that, Nami-san?Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.10,0:30:53.30,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Please be watching me...Dialogue: 50,0:30:53.30,0:30:55.80,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,See how much stronger I've become.Dialogue: 50,0:30:55.80,0:30:58.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.54,0:31:03.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Respond, Platoon 5! What's going on?!Dialogue: 50,0:31:03.55,0:31:05.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-We're...Dialogue: 50,0:31:05.61,0:31:10.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're facing... an unexpected obstacle...Dialogue: 50,0:31:10.25,0:31:11.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!Dialogue: 50,0:31:14.22,0:31:18.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you reject us like that!Dialogue: 50,0:31:18.26,0:31:20.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're all shy.Dialogue: 50,0:31:20.70,0:31:23.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be ashamed!Dialogue: 50,0:31:24.20,0:31:27.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go out for tea sometime!Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.90,0:31:31.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I-I'm going... I'm going crazy, aren't I?!Dialogue: 50,0:31:34.44,0:31:38.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! You've got such a cute face!Dialogue: 50,0:31:38.21,0:31:39.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, don't do it!Dialogue: 50,0:31:42.25,0:31:44.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Answer, Platoon 5!Dialogue: 50,0:31:46.76,0:31:49.02,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kyun, now's your chance!Dialogue: 50,0:31:51.46,0:31:53.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, what's wrong, Sanji?!Dialogue: 50,0:31:55.06,0:32:00.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I-I don't know... Suddenly, it felt like someone was squeezing my heart...Dialogue: 50,0:32:00.24,0:32:01.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I removed the buoyancy bag!Dialogue: 50,0:32:01.87,0:32:04.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! What about the sail?Dialogue: 50,0:32:04.04,0:32:06.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're ready when you are!Dialogue: 50,0:32:06.91,0:32:08.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it time to go, Nami?Dialogue: 50,0:32:08.41,0:32:10.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, at your command, Captain.Dialogue: 50,0:32:17.75,0:32:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright...Dialogue: 50,0:32:23.43,0:32:25.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys!Dialogue: 50,0:32:26.26,0:32:31.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's so much I want to tell you, but first of all,Dialogue: 50,0:32:31.23,0:32:35.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,thank you for going along with my selfish decision for two years!Dialogue: 50,0:32:35.24,0:32:38.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not as if that's the first time.Dialogue: 50,0:32:38.04,0:32:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's right! You've always been that way!Dialogue: 50,0:32:45.81,0:32:49.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rear Admiral, the pirate ship is submerging!Dialogue: 50,0:32:49.72,0:32:51.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Curses!Dialogue: 50,0:32:51.72,0:32:53.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn you!Dialogue: 50,0:32:53.09,0:32:54.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea...Dialogue: 50,0:32:54.99,0:32:57.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,how evil those pirates are? Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:32:57.56,0:32:58.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rear Admiral!Dialogue: 50,0:32:59.96,0:33:02.53,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Take care, Luffy...Dialogue: 50,0:33:05.40,0:33:07.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfurl the sails!Dialogue: 50,0:33:07.57,0:33:08.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:33:16.41,0:33:19.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Set sail!Dialogue: 50,0:33:19.41,0:33:21.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:33:28.29,0:33:32.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go to Fishman Island!Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.53,0:02:37.31,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Dive, Dive, Dive!Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.53,0:02:37.31,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Dive, Dive, Dive!Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.22,0:03:33.76,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,Grove 41Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.22,0:03:33.76,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,Grove 41Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.69,0:20:42.46,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats' Rendezvous Point, Grove 42 ShoreDialogue: 1,0:20:37.69,0:20:42.46,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats' Rendezvous Point, Grove 42 ShoreDialogue: 0,0:00:14.37,0:00:18.40,Credits,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:14.37,0:00:18.40,Credits,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:14.37,0:00:18.40,Credits,,0,0,0,,Gigglebot Galaxy 9000 iconsumekidneysDialogue: 1,0:00:14.37,0:00:18.40,Credits,,0,0,0,,Gigglebot Galaxy 9000 iconsumekidneysDialogue: 0,0:00:18.40,0:00:21.47,Credits,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 1,0:00:18.40,0:00:21.47,Credits,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 0,0:00: